Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the running Living Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The original coastal center, eighty-one\Nnew buildings, and a wooded natural reserve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,share one playable world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This opening is a labelled camera\Ninspection of the actual game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Streets follow changing ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Buildings turn with their frontages,\Nand planted courts break up the blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond the town, paths lead into\Nwoodland, mountain slopes, and visitor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,facilities. We will walk between these places as Aria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We choose the existing resident Aria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Her upper home remains above the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.23,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name, job, money, needs, and\Nsaved identity belong to the same life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,simulation. The refined\Ncharacter is a real articulated
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,three-dimensional model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Her five needs stay visible\Nin the compact resident card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Time and speed controls remain at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can expand the activity history and daily\Nwishes when needed, then close them to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the town in view.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Aria takes the actual stairs downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Walls and furnishings constrain her route.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Door openings and clear landings matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.81,0:01:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Each floor has its own spatial address,\Nso an upstairs resident cannot interact
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,through a ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,At the cafe table, we open the\Nreal action menu and choose a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Aria approaches the furnishing and uses it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The recording checks an actual completion\Nevent and a measurable need change, rather
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,than mistaking a closed menu for success.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The counter also offers the\Nexisting permitted actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We observe the result, then\Nleave through the cafe entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Interior cutaways expose the active floor\Nwhile neighboring roofs stay in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The original access rules continue to apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside, Aria keeps normal depth\Nagainst buildings and vegetation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When geometry blocks the controlled resident,\Nan amber mesh silhouette preserves her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,location. The main character\Nstays shaded by the scene, and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,ordinary residents keep their own depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we walk from the original\Ncenter into a new district.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A screen click requests the actual entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The camera returns to Aria so\Nthe journey remains visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Every step comes from the existing movement system.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a connected extension of the running town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Roads, approaches, building pads, and\Nentrances share an authored terrain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,profile. The new building has\Nactual rooms and furniture, with
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,reachable interaction positions beside its fixtures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside the new venue, we use a physical\Nfurnishing through the same action menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The recorded outcome comes from the simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:05:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Selected new fixtures reuse compatible\Nexisting actions, while shelves,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,flowers, and decorative objects remain visual detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where this venue has another floor,\Nwe take its genuine stairs and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The model exposes the selected level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Floor slabs and door gaps agree with the\Nauthored spatial profile, preserving room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,boundaries and usable circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next journey reaches the\Nreserve visitor facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Woodland surrounds the town\Nrather than ending at a flat edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The route follows connected paths and terraces,\Nwith building thresholds attached to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,same graded landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At the public bathhouse, we enter through\Nthe actual door and use a hygiene fixture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shower, basin, and toilet areas\Nhave separate compartments and clear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,approaches. The service applies the\Nexisting need rules and produces a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,real completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The camping area contains furnished trailers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Aria walks to one and enters\Nthrough its actual doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Compact circulation, storage, kitchen\Nfittings, sleeping space, and the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,bathroom make this a small interior\Nrather than an empty exterior shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We use a real trailer fixture through\Nthe normal menu, then return outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These close views show furniture grouping,\Nmaterial scale, and the character pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Detailed models support the activity;\Nthey do not grant movement through a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The return to town uses the\Nsame real walking controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aria leaves the camping area and follows the\Nconnected paths back through the expanded
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,districts. Her position changes\None legal step at a time; the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,camera follows the resident throughout.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The cafe is our original point of departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Reaching its door again closes a complete\Ntrip from the old center to the new town and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,reserve, and back. Doorways, room changes, and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,furnishing actions all use\Nthe existing life simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We now pause for labelled architectural inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These camera cuts show the ravine bridge,\Nthe mountain stone stairs, and their
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,surrounding vegetation. They do not\Nimply that Aria has crossed every
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.34,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,structure shown by the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The pond has graded banks and planted edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Trees, understory, flowers, and\Nhorticultural groupings create different
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,scales of enclosure. Shared botanical\Nmeshes are batched by area in the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,running game, while stable identities\Nremain in the asset catalog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We return to actual resident life,\Nsave with F five, continue, and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,load with F eight. The recording\Nverifies the saved tick and spatial
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,address. A changed or incompatible\Ntown profile is rejected
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of silently moving the resident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.95,0:12:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,After loading, we enable existing free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:13:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Needs, jobs, access, and circumstances\Nguide the next decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.89,0:13:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The renderer follows those decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not create another simulation,\Nand the recording does not force a desired
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,social response.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We have followed real walking, rooms,\Nservices, stairs, and saved life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Separate building reports cover the wider\Ntown and distinguish camera inspections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Editable Blender sources, portable\Nmodels, the playable town, and recorded
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,evidence travel together. This final\Noverview still shows the running
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,game.
